    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1308">

                <pb facs="1570" n="1372" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1372"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Department of the Army Files: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 1308<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of War</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stimson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting
                        Chairman of the Interim Committee</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Harrison</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">urgent</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-21">21 July, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Victory</hi> 189. Reference <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">War</hi> 35987<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1308-f1"/> from
                    Stimson to Pasco for Harrison’s <hi rendition="#small-caps">Eyes Only</hi>.
                    Message begins: Aware of no factors to change my decision. On the contrary new
                    factors here tend to confirm it. End.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
